This product implements the A2A Discover Protocol (ADP) Core v1, published at
https://github.com/YY-Yifei/a2a-discover (specification:
https://github.com/YY-Yifei/a2a-discover/blob/main/spec/adp-core.md). The protocol specification and its reference implementation are
published by their authors under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This product talks to agents over the Agent2Agent (A2A) protocol, published at
https://a2a-protocol.org. A2A is an independent specification; this project
neither modifies nor redistributes it.

